+   LS - lecture section

    a lecture is a collation of related learning material.
    at time of writing, there's two types:

    * TextLectureSection
    * VideoLectureSection

    the text section contains a title header and one or more paragraphs
    the video section contains a video title and a video url.

    the specific content doesn't matter just that `LS` is a means of adding structure to each lecture.